Add libcurl-based url_backend with SOCKS proxy support

Adds `curl` as a selectable url_backend (-Durl_backend=curl), implemented
with libcurl's easy API. Supports SOCKS4/4a/5/5h proxies via CURLOPT_PROXY,
set explicitly through apk_io_url_set_proxy() (not wired to a CLI flag yet)
or picked up from the standard ALL_PROXY / all_proxy environment variables,
e.g. ALL_PROXY=socks5h://127.0.0.1:1080.

The transfer runs in a worker thread feeding a pipe via CURLOPT_WRITEFUNCTION,
since apk_istream is a synchronous pull interface while curl_easy_perform()
is blocking/push-based.

